# Way of the Necromancer (turn 1, off Moxen): empower Jace 2 makes a Jace token with 2 loyalty. "Whenever a creature you control
# dies" is narrow on both sides: on turn 2 Bot2 destroys Bot1's Mox Pearl with Vandalblast (a noncreature permanent Bot1 controls
# dies), and on turn 3 Bot1's Flame Slash kills Bot2's Ornithopter (a creature Bot1 does not control dies). Neither adds a loyalty
# counter: Bot1's Jace token stays at 2, and Bot2's own Jace token (Way of the Healer) stays at 5.

